      "status": "accepted",
      "basis": "description_checked",
      "allocationWeight": 1,
      "reason": "Covers regular complex scalar-gravity saddles with a vanishing-scale-factor end and an approach to real expanding cosmology.",
      "qualification": "n4 retains the joint regularity, vanishing-scale-factor and real-expansion conditions for complex scalar-gravity saddles. q4 does not establish this cosmological boundary-value target merely by covering other instanton solutions.",
      "evidenceRefs": [
        {
